	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You have continued your journey of self-mastery, athleticism, and holistic combat training. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Dexterity, Constitution, or Wisdom score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>Your exertion pool increases by 1.</p></li><li><p>You gain a skill specialty in Acrobatics and a skill specialty in Athletics. They do not count against your skill specialties known.</p></li><li><p>You gain an additional @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.k9a86qhku4stw0kg]{Focus Feature}. It does not count against your focus features known.</p></li><li><p>You gain an additional combat maneuver of a degree you could learn from a combat tradition available to the adept class or your archetype. You do not need to be proficient with the tradition the maneuver comes from to select it.</p></li></ul>",
